       /\ AsyncCausalQueueOwnership(node, RestartAvailableBodyReplay(node))
       /\ SequenceHasUniqueValues(RestartAvailableBodyReplay(node))
PROOF
  <1>1. ASSUME NEW node, TypeInvariant, node \in ValidatorIds,
